# Function with constraint using 'each' combinator
# Verifies a TypeVar can have multiple constraints via [each Comparable Showable]
[
  display-sorted: [fn@[bind: [a]  constraint: [a: [each Comparable Showable]]  return: String]
    [let xs@[Seq a]]
    "sorted"]
  result: [display-sorted [seq 3 [seq 1 [seq 2 []]]]]
]

---

%.result
=== out
String("sorted")
